<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>More about Jesus let me learn,</l><l>More of His holy will discern;</l><l>Spirit of God my teacher be,</l><l>Showing the things of Christ to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>More about Jesus; in His Word,</l><l>Holding communion with my Lord;</l><l>Hearing His voice in every line,</l><l>Making each faithful saying mine.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>More about Jesus; on His throne,</l><l>Riches in glory all His own;</l><l>More of His kingdom’s sure increase;</l><l>More of His coming, Prince of Peace.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
